direction_593 = location "Giant Bulcan" about "Giant Bulcan\nA representative monster of Moradon which produces iron by extracting iron elements from their stomachs. " found "Moradon" at 382 405 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Master, do you know a monster called the Giant Bulcan? No? Let's go and ask [Sentinel Patrick] about it."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "The Giant Bulcan? Yeah, he's an enormous bugger, even by Bulcan standards. Bulcans have no eyes so they hate it when you go up close and mess with them."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Here's a thought... Go out and catch 10 Bulcans to start."

On in_progress
    Say "Nail the Giant Bulcan after you've taken care of all the others."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_593

On ready
    Say "Phew! Well done master. Did the world of good for your abilities and experience eh? Ha ha!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Obviously, the harder the hunt, the more EXP you'll get from it.\n\nGood job. Your skills got a good workout there eh master?."
